  "prefLabel": "Bea 507.07 Funding Round Priorities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 507.07 Funding Round Priorities. To facilitate the most effective use of HIM grant program funding, for each funding round the department shall set program priorities for that round prior to advertising the funding opportunity and application details for the round. This determination shall be based on the amount of funding available and the emergent needs of HC designation municipalities.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea500.html"
